 thinner bar.)  To turn off cursors in non-selected windows, change the
 variable @code{cursor-in-non-selected-windows} to @code{nil}.
 
+@vindex cursor-animation-duration
+@cindex cursor animation
+  The variable @code{cursor-animation-duration} specifies the duration
+of cursor animation in seconds.  Its default value is 0.1.  During a
+movement, the cursor is stretched between its old and new positions,
+with a trail behind it, and shrinks into the new position instead of
+jumping there at once.  Set this variable to @code{nil} to disable the
+animation.  The cursor does not move like this on images.  This is only
+supported on macOS and on GTK with Wayland.
+
 @node Line Truncation
 @section Line Truncation
 
